un, J.; Perez, E.; et al.","date":"2022","dcterms:source":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2211.03540","grade":"secondary","title":"Measuring Progress on Scalable Oversight for Large Language Models","verifiedOn":"2026-09-29T00:00:00Z"}]}
